    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95598" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοναρόν:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥωμαλέον</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i> (fort. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοβ-</span> vel <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σθεν-</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σόος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Ep.
		 and 
			Ion.
		 form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῶος, σῶς</span>: <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῶς</span>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σορδισμός:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μὴ καθαρῶς διαλέγεσθαι ἤτοι
				ἑλληνίζειν</span>, Id.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαρδισμός</span>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σορεῖον</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σόρειον</span></b> , 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σορίδιον</span>
			.</div>
